<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner shares in Azerbaijan rig deal.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner shares in Azerbaijan rig deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian industrial group Kvaerner ASA said on Friday it had signed a NOK 650 million letter of intent for upgrading an exploration rig in Baku, Azerbaijan, together with Den Norske Stats Oljeselskap AS (Statoil) and British Petroleum.</p>
</text>
